          "gen": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "Driller ID is the hydraulic version of Driller: the same light drilling unit for the holes the diamond wire passes through, but with a hydraulic rotary head and hydraulic feed from a power pack with a petrol, diesel or electric motor.",
          "gen": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "The ID 160 rotary head gives a higher torque than the pneumatic head. Column for extension rods of 1,000 or 1,500 mm, a down-the-hole hammer up to 3 inches for holes up to 95 mm, and a down jack with a ball joint for drilling in any direction.",
          "gen": true
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "Feed stroke: 1,760 mm",
            "Rotary torque: 1,600 Nm",
